<h3>About College Algebra</h3>

<p>This project repurposes an OpenStax textbook to suit Passaic County Community College&rsquo;s specific needs by creating&nbsp;an original pdf workbook for students, and developing a MyOpenMath course shell for distribution to adjuncts. A guide on how to use the materials is included as well.</p>

